# Interview log

When this session uses a **distinct Cursor product capability** in a meaningful way
(Plan mode, Bugbot, Security Review, MCP, rules, canvas, skills, Cloud Agents,
subagents, etc.), append a row to [`docs/cursor-interview-log.md`](docs/cursor-interview-log.md):

- when (date or stream)
- capability name as Cursor ships it
- what we actually did
- the interview beat (one sentence)

Do not add rows for ordinary Agent edits, greps, or commits. The log is evidence,
not a changelog. Prefer updating that file over starting a new chat or subagent
just to “remember” features — subagents do not persist.
